    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Interesting. You mentioned \"communal lifestyle\" and \"immigrant community\" for River Point as factors for spread. Can you expand on that? I'm trying to understand if you're seeing specific cultural or behavioral patterns in those groups that make them higher risk compared to, say, the more individualistic lifestyle in Oak Ridge.",
